<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Wihtred of Kent</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 725</span> · <a href="/centuries/8th-century">8th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Wihtred was king of Kent from about 690 to 725, restoring stability after a period of invasion and disputed succession. His law code of 695 deals mainly with the Church, setting penalties for pagan worship, unlawful marriage and failure to keep the Sabbath, and he granted the Kentish churches freedom from taxation. His long reign was a time of peace.</p></div>
